### Class ###
	Index   0=DW 1=DK 2=FE 3=MG 4=DL 5=SU 6=RF. -1 = all 7 classes.

### Class::Item ###
	Reset/MReset   Which Reset/MasterReset count this reward fires on,
	             -1 = every reset.
	UserType0-3    How many of this item to grant, per account VIP
	             level (Free/Bronze/Silver/Gold).
	Type/Index     Item code (GET_ITEM(Type,Index) - matches Item.xml).
	Level          Item level.
	Luck/Durability/Skill   NOTE: named to match the C++ struct fields
	             they feed (REWARD_ITEM_INFO), not literal
	             luck/durability/skill - the original file's own
	             column header used different labels (Dur/Skill/Luck)
	             than what the loader actually reads into. Kept as-is
	             to not change gameplay.
	Option/Excellent/Ancient/JOH/OpEx   Item option rolls.
	Socket1-5      Socket seed per slot, 255 = none.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

